@table
Fertility fact | Figure
**Replacement TFR** | **2.1**
India's TFR | 2.4 (Census 2011), **2.3 (SRS 2016)**, **2.2 (NFHS-4, 2015-16)**, **2.0 (NFHS-5, 2019-21)**, **1.9 (SRS 2021-23)**
Highest TFR states | **Bihar**, UP, MP, Rajasthan
